{
  "bookId": "rewind-29",
  "id": "chapter-113",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24560001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "叫嚣得这么厉害，原来只有这点本事吗？也不知道克罗赛尔看中你这个小鬼哪点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "大、大胆庶民，本王只是还没有准备好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "闹剧该结束了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我躲！哈哈哈笨蛋，本王怎么可能这么轻易被射中！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "坏女人，你给本王记着，本王迟早有一天会找回场子的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哇啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "这不是你自己设置的陷阱吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "咳咳，本王日理万机，怎么可能记得这种小事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你你你不要放箭啊，本王还要好几张底牌没有使出来呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "刚才不算，有本事把本王放下来，咱们再战三百回合！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24560012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哇啊啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "咦——我没事？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……是谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你藏在那里多久了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "这一切都是你在背后指使的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "为什么要做这种事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "咦——？！你是怎么从手办监狱逃出的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "原来是一个喜欢多管闲事的家伙。\n直接从监狱里逃走多好呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "非要赶来送死。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "喂，等一下！你还没回答我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "憎恶·之矢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24570011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "啧，不是可以好好交流的对象吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-612",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "paojie1",
          "rowIds": [
            24560001,
