      ],
      "title": "极恶搭档·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24580001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "电击能力者？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580002",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "（……又躲过了，通过电磁力强行改变了自身的移动方向吗？）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "好险！\n不过我已经摸清了你的攻击方式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "既然你不肯好好说话，那就只能让你倒下了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "笨蛋青蛙，我们都是绝缘材质的手办，你的攻击不管多少次都不会有效果的！！而她只需要射中你一箭，一切就结束了！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "我在手办监狱就已经明白了这一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "但是啊，这个世界上可没有绝对的绝缘体。\n只要温度和电压足够高……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "——电击之枪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "什……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "打中了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "现在，我们能好好交谈了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "失去意识了？\n……明明我控制了电流啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "青蛙女居然这么厉害……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "什么青蛙女，我叫御坂美琴！\n而且这也不是普通的青蛙，它叫呱太！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "别动啊，我帮你松绑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "青蛙女！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "都说了我叫……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "她醒过来了——小心！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24580020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "湮灭·之矢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24590001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "铛！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24590002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哈哈，还好我们及时赶到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24590003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "哼，又是你们几个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24590004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "她、她要逃跑了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-613",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
