      "title": "极恶搭档·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24600001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可恶，这家伙逃得真快！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "……优纪，你们怎么来了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "手办监狱那边看起来没什么问题了，而且有黑子在维护秩序。\n我们有点担心你，就赶过来啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "多谢，现在危机已经解除了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "莉可，虽然你是被人利用的，但是这件事毕竟是因你而起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "我现在放了你，你可要跟我回去好好向大家道歉才行！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "（靠……靠得好近！！）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "（又强大又帅气，大家都很佩服她的样子……）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "好了！\n嗯，你脸怎么红了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "谁谁脸红了？！别以为救了我我就会念着你的好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "砰！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "糟糕，是烟雾弹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "本王才不要回去道歉呢！\n你们给本王等着，本王下次一定会干出震惊全世界的大事的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "众手办",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "要追吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24600016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "咳咳咳，算了吧……已经跑远了。\n而且，总觉得这个事情还没有完全解决。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24610001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "对了，你们知道克罗赛尔是谁吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24610002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "克罗赛尔？这件事和她也有关系？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24610003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "怎么了吗，那个用箭的女人有提到这个名字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24610004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这两个大坏蛋什么时候混到一块去了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24610005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "等、等一下……如果她们是两人一起行动的话，那克罗赛尔现在在哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24610006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御坂美琴",
          "text": "……不好，黑子可能有危险！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-614",
